---
---

<header class="relative gradient-purple text-white py-16 pt-28 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative blobs -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute -top-20 -right-20 w-80 h-80 bg-accent-pink/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-20 w-80 h-80 bg-secondary-light/15 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center">
    <h2 data-animate class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4">
      Pride in Microbiology Community Voices
    </h2>
    <hr class="w-16 mx-auto border-t-2 border-white/30 mb-6" />
    <div data-animate data-delay="150" class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-3 text-white/80 text-lg">
      <p>
        Pride in Microbiology is proud to publish commentaries from authors across the 2SLGBTQIA+ community in the field of Microbiology. Here, you'll find stories about building connections, tackling barriers, digging into research, or pushing for change.
      </p>
      <p>
        Interested in contributing? Contact our primary editor, Dr. Landon Getz, at landon (dot) getz (at) utoronto (dot) ca or fill out this <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdnpS8ykckkieUQAOXo_2bmAvJOU4Aunrnmy1eINdIikhQK_Q/viewform?usp=publish-editor" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-white font-bold hover:underline">pitch form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
